1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Your computer. Your playground. Phase one. A connected desktop for everyday life and play.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Start with an idea. Search apps, return to a recent file or ask Hermes in the same Start menu.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:51,400
Make room as you go. Actual Files, Kate, settings, tiling and fullscreen interactions.

4
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:57,400
Ask. See. Decide. Read system information, see each step and approve proposed shell commands.

5
00:00:57,400 --> 00:01:04,400
Choose where it runs. Local model, network endpoint or cloud provider. Changes apply to a new conversation.

6
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:10,400
Keep the useful bits. Capture a region, window or screen. Edit shortcuts right where you use them.

7
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:16,400
Copy. Pin. Carry on. A screenshot flows into the gallery and clipboard. Pin the things you need again.

8
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:22,400
One update overview. See status across the desktop, games and apps. Open the responsible app to install.

9
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:28,400
Make this space yours. Light and dark appearance, six accents, wallpapers and native settings in one window.

10
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:33,400
One desktop. A continuous flow. Start an idea. Make room. Step into play. Return to what matters.
